| q1 | 3048.955 | 926.826 | 3.290x |
| q3 | 1319.368 | 1073.424 | 1.229x |
| q4 | 1648.182 | 1274.599 | 1.293x |
| q5 | 3278.014 | 1026.755 | 3.193x |
| q6 | 607.870 | 603.361 | 1.007x |
| q7 | 1244.085 | 1152.389 | 1.080x |
| q8 | 3814.888 | 1167.318 | 3.268x |
